@federal_committee
title: Revolt in the Federal Committee
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: revolt_possible = 1 and sanchez_leader = 1 and rebellion_used = 0
on-arrival: {! Q.rebellion_used = 1; !}

= Revolt in the Federal Committee

Half of the Federal Executive resigns at once, intending to force your fall. The critics demand a caretaker committee and an end to your strategy.

- @fight: Fight it out in the Federal Committee
- @members: Resign and take your case to the members

@fight
on-arrival: {!
Q.committee_won = (Q.federal_committee_balance + Q.member_morale / 5 >= 55) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.committee_won) {
    Q.sanchez_authority += 10; Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 10; Q.federal_committee_balance += 5;
} else {
    if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.oust(Q, false); window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, 'psoe', {up: 0.6, cs: 0.4}, {students: 1, workers: 1}); }
}
!}
go-to: fight_won if committee_won = 1; ousted if committee_won = 0

@fight_won
title: You survive

= You survive

After a day of shouting in the corridors of Ferraz, the vote goes your way. Your critics will wait for another chance.

@members
on-arrival: {! Q.populism += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.oust(Q, false); } !}
go-to: ousted

@ousted
title: Sánchez falls

= Sánchez falls

You are no longer Secretary-General. [? if leadership_exception_open = 1 : A caretaker committee takes over Ferraz. Your seat in Congress, your car, your office: all gone. But the members have not spoken yet, and the next primary is due in May 2017. ?]

@primary
title: The primary
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: leadership_exception_open = 1 and endorsements_done = 1 and ((year = 2017 and month >= 5) or year >= 2018)
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.primaryVote(Q); } else { Q.primary_won = (Q.member_morale + Q.sanchismo / 2 >= 60) ? 1 : 0; }
Q.leadership_exception_open = 0;
if (Q.primary_won) {
    Q.sanchez_leader = 1; Q.sanchez_authority = 70; Q.sanchismo += 20; Q.member_morale += 10;
    Q.federal_committee_balance = 60;
    Q.red_lines = 0; Q.psoe_leader = 'Pedro Sánchez'; Q.psoe_interim = 0; Q.backbench = 0;
} else {
    Q.psoe_leader = Q.pv_winner_name; Q.psoe_interim = 0;
    if (!Q.retired) { Q.backbench = 1; Q.backbench_since = Q.time; }
    if (Q.lopez_won && Q.sanchez_backs_lopez === 2) { Q.rel_leadership = 85; Q.lopez_gives_post = 1; }
    if (Q.lopez_won && Q.sanchez_backs_lopez) { Q.sanchismo += 3; Q.rel_leadership = Math.max(Q.rel_leadership || 40, 70); }
}
!}
on-display: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.renderPrimary(Q, 'sp-primary-result'); window.SpainGame.renderPollChange(Q, 'sp-primary-pollchange', 'primary'); }
!}

= 21 May 2017: the primary

[? if sanchez_backs_lopez = 0 : [? if primary_moderniser = 0 : Three candidates stand: you, Susana Díaz with the regional barons and the old guard behind her, and Patxi López in between. ?][? if primary_moderniser = 1 : You face Susana Díaz, with the regional barons and the old guard behind her, [? if tapias_out = 0 : and José Antonio Pérez Tapias for the Socialist Left, who says you have become what you fought against. ?][? if tapias_out = 1 : after José Antonio Pérez Tapias failed to collect enough endorsements to stand. ?] [? if lopez_endorses = 1 : Patxi López campaigns at your side. ?][? if lopez_endorses = 0 : Patxi López has stayed out of the race, and out of your campaign. ?] ?] You launched your campaign in Dos Hermanas, in Díaz's own province of Seville, and have spent months touring the local branches in your own car. ?][? if sanchez_backs_lopez > 0 : Patxi López faces Susana Díaz, with your members behind him. You campaign for him across Spain. ?]

Nearly 150,000 members vote.

{!<div id="sp-primary-result"></div>!}

{!<div id="sp-primary-pollchange"></div>!}

[? if primary_won = 1 : Against the regional barons, the elders and the apparatus, Pedro Sánchez is Secretary-General again. The people who removed you spent months running the party; now they must work for you. ?][? if primary_won = 0 : [? if lopez_won = 1 : Patxi López is the new Secretary-General. [? if lopez_gives_post = 1 : As agreed, he keeps the "no es no" line and makes you part of his Executive. ?][? if lopez_gives_post = 0 : He thanks you for your support. Your followers wonder whether it should have been you. ?] ?][? if lopez_won = 0 : The members choose [+ pv_winner_name +]. [? if sanchez_backs_lopez = 0 : Your comeback is over, for now. ?] ?] ?]

@deadlock_vote
