- @fca_cs: Against Ciudadanos
- @fca_up: Against [+ up_brand +]
- @fca_vox: Against Vox
- @fca_psoe: Against the PSOE
- @fca_iu: Against Izquierda Unida
- @fca_catind: Against the Catalan independence parties (ERC, Junts, CUP)
- @fca_basque: Against the Basque nationalists (PNV, Bildu)
- @fca_minor: Against the regionalist parties (CC, BNG, Més, PRC, Foro and others)
- @final_campaign: Back

