= The blackout

At 12:33 on 28 April 2025 the whole Iberian peninsula goes dark. Trains stop in tunnels, traffic lights fail, people listen to transistor radios in the street. Power returns overnight. The argument over renewables, nuclear and the grid operator lasts for months.

