= Junts breaks the pact

From Waterloo, Carles Puigdemont announces that Junts is breaking with the PSOE: the amnesty has not been applied to him, Catalan is still not official in the European Union, the powers over immigration have not arrived. Junts will vote against every bill and every budget. Your majority is gone; the legislature will go on without budgets.

- @junts_court: Court Junts back with new concessions
- @junts_alone: Govern by decree and dare them to bring you down

@junts_court
title: Back to Waterloo
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_junts += 15; Q.const_line += 0.5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', { pensioners: -0.4, self_employed: -0.3 }); } !}

Another envoy, another document. Junts listens, and promises nothing.

@junts_alone
title: Governing alone
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 3; Q.budget_timer = 12; !}

Without Junts there will be no budget. You govern with what you have.

