= Montero goes south

María Jesús Montero, First Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Finance, leaves the government to lead the PSOE into the Andalusian election against Juanma Moreno. Seven years of budgets and regional financing leave with her. Carlos Cuerpo and the new Finance team inherit a government without a budget.

