= Crisis in Ceuta

In July 2026 thousands of people, many of them teenagers, swim and climb into Ceuta as the Moroccan border police look away. The army is deployed on the beach of El Tarajal.

- @ceuta_firm: Close the border and send the army
- @ceuta_rabat: Call Rabat and settle it quietly

@ceuta_firm
title: The army on the beach
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', { pensioners: 0.3, self_employed: 0.2 }); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', -1); } Q.progressives_dissent += 3; Q.rel_up -= 4; !}

The images are hard, and the border holds.

@ceuta_rabat
