= The Socialist Left walks out

[+ left_split_leader +] announces that he and the Izquierda Socialista current are leaving the PSOE. "This is no longer the party of Pablo Iglesias Posse." [+ left_split_deputies +] deputies go with him: most join Podemos's group, the rest go to Izquierda Unida. Senators, regional deputies and councillors follow across the country, and Podemos claims them as proof that it is the real left.

[? if left_split_cost_majority = 1 : **The government has lost its majority in Congress.** Every vote from now on needs new partners. ?]

